@startuml
title MEDORA: Encounter Lifecycle
!include ../../../../shared/templates/medora-style.puml
skinparam dpi 192
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
state "In Consultation" as InConsultation
state "Awaiting Service" as AwaitingService
state "Awaiting Closure" as AwaitingClosure
[*] --> Waiting : checkIn()\n[identity and appointment/walk-in valid] \n/ assign queue
Waiting --> InConsultation : startConsultation()\n[assigned clinician authorized]
InConsultation --> AwaitingService : requestService()\n[order created]
AwaitingService --> InConsultation : reviewResult()\n[required result recorded]
InConsultation --> AwaitingClosure : submitForClosure()
AwaitingClosure --> InConsultation : returnForCorrection()\n[required item missing]
AwaitingClosure --> Completed : completeEncounter()\n[authorized and checklist satisfied] \n/ sign summary
note right of Completed
  Completion is a controlled clinical transition. Invoice settlement
  remains a separate financial lifecycle.
end note
Completed --> [*]
@enduml
